{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b33825f18741bae22f6db2f863f367c9c22d9de588208daa51312d98932ed61", "ja": "（やよいの新年向けポスター撮影のため、\n旅館に来ている。そろそろ準備できたかな？）", "zh": "（为了拍摄弥生的新年海报，我们来到了日式旅馆。差不多准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "7ccb829b41fd3be1947a66d95f9e6a3a170c1cfadc10d90003c94d106a0e550d", "ja": "はわわっ！　{$P$}、大変です！", "zh": "哇哇！{$P$}先生，不好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e71c06a4634b6e0e4a45494cdc5f643b317865d2a260b0a1a619cbc05217c07f", "ja": "どうしたんだやよい。そんな慌てて。", "zh": "怎么了，弥生？这么慌慌张张的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "619ca501d2bbe11ef4551bebd330a0c7edccc97317f255f6d9c8825ec8565a23", "ja": "今見てきちゃったんですけど、用意してもらった\nおせちのお重、とーっても豪華ですごいんです！", "zh": "我刚才去看了一下，您帮忙准备的御节料理盒，特别豪华，太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bd1fa9f3cc745e4a58df8ccbd9c93875322a3376ecc1db26bba7561937107047", "ja": "そうなのか！　……いや、今回撮影のおせちの内容は、\nやよいが事前に提案してくれたもののはずだろう？", "zh": "是这样吗！……不对，这次拍摄用的年节料理内容，应该是弥生事先提议的方案吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "f0561df9f3388b0ecb1e46c7235b7f7c0686a4a40c544b3142d716130d53c337", "ja": "そ、それが……ホントに私の提案したまんまの\n夢みたいな中身で……ビックリしちゃって……。", "zh": "可、可是……里面的内容真的和我提议的一模一样，简直像做梦一样……我都吓了一跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "01c8561731478e7d9cbe93f21f7537e75c759d0f7e06287cf4963b137290cda5", "ja": "私の好きなものが、たっくさん箱に詰められてて、\nうれしいっていうのは、もちろんありますけど……。", "zh": "箱子里装满了好多好多我喜欢的东西，开心是当然的啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "3fd01bffe0d5b7f8d2bf56014a31a5b6856d354164e28f71f84b403bf5091d00", "ja": "だけどおうちのお正月だと、あんなすごいおせち\n見たことないから……ど、どうしようかな～って……。", "zh": "可是，在家过新年的时候，我从没见过那么豪华的御节料理……所、所以我该怎么办才好呢～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a9a3bf4ba0b6cd295e416bc842ac6a3b452625033d754980e9e978541814583b", "ja": "とりあえず落ち着こう、やよい。今回の撮影は\nその豪華特製おせちを宣伝する機会でもあるんだ。", "zh": "总之先冷静下来吧，弥生。这次的拍摄也是宣传那份豪华特制年菜的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "dfc8a4e0e0f68aa12982fe6da6d5cfa8b95c1678ff21c7382602ea9ffd585f12", "ja": "あの……撮影前にこんなこと聞くのもなんですけど。\nおせち、あとで持って帰れたりしますか……？", "zh": "那个……虽然在拍摄前问这个不太合适。\n年节菜，之后可以带回家吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7dd49a6c1c408132495cddea66437e46bac4fbcd5247b53a1b7eaa46b325907e", "ja": "数はじゅうぶん用意してるし、大丈夫だと思うよ。\nあとでスタッフさんにも確認してみよう。", "zh": "份量准备得很充足，我想应该没问题的。\n等会儿我也去跟工作人员确认一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "3225a2cbfbde428ba12ec1f1d789ad98d0dc7a8ee210253af5dc5af7dbcd3f9e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\nえへへ、今から楽しみです。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}！\n诶嘿嘿，我现在就期待起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "86abf8db4d0bd58dbe59069648def14e844f5fb723b46bc4fd0fbb6a11f348ec", "ja": "私、おせちのフタをあける瞬間が大好きなんです。\nカパッて開けたらキラキラしてて、宝箱みたいって。", "zh": "我超喜欢揭开年节料理盖子的那一瞬间。\n\"啪\"地一打开，里面闪闪发光的，就像宝箱一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e8fca064bd6416e4150e183f799b25c35393f8a6a1522395fc41ee8ede80cd89", "ja": "宝箱か……確かに開けた時のワクワクは、\n他のお弁当とは違う、何か特別な感じだよな。", "zh": "宝箱吗……确实，打开时的那份雀跃，\n和其他便当不同，有种特别的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "52f3522d3ca0e68cf2e0d8b5f5d6a79879a82c8b3ca42da22f359be4bd90f645", "ja": "はい、特別で！　……あ、特別って思いすぎて、\n私の考えたおせち、ちょっと変かもでしたけど……。", "zh": "对，很特别！……啊，因为太觉得特别了，我想的年节菜好像有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "6ad23693dfea37fba6d6ab48f1983fb7d276755f034a5a1586812793be6a266f", "ja": "普通は、エビやタイと一緒にハンバーガーは\nおせちに入れないですよね？", "zh": "一般来说，汉堡包是不会和虾、鲷鱼一起放进年节料理里的对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d068a249b79df8060e84e4093a933b47ab4ad891a0e37641c62d710984f5aac8", "ja": "うん。でも、そこがやよいらしくていいと思う！\nところで……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，我觉得这种地方很有弥生的风格，挺好的！\n话说回来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e690e9b4cc93a2623b91e703fdde3e7d823b23c64ffddb8acea307c8c7c09245", "ja": "おせちのお重と一緒に、黒豆の煮方のレシピの紙を\nつけてくれたのもやよいの提案なのかな？", "zh": "把年节盒饭一起送来的那张黑豆煮法食谱，也是弥生提议的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "504a8d094cdcabddd10b731f2d47b407a30f4ead0b30779f304448289f535d84", "ja": "あっ。そうなんです！　うちのお母さんが毎年黒豆を\n煮るんですけど、それがすごくおいしくて！", "zh": "啊。是的！我妈妈每年都会煮\n黑豆，煮出来的黑豆可好吃啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "73a55394cc487a4599279c6c8fd4ac49d8e417ecd0efefc26a2393703eaccebf", "ja": "私も最近作り方を教わって、お豆を練習中です。\nみんなにも、たくさん作って食べて欲しくて。", "zh": "我最近也刚学会做法，现在正在练习做豆子。我想做很多给大家吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5280efb737c78cd19d8c0b7e4992e41d5bc6a298e62ec7bb5d06d242e9db3976", "ja": "なるほど。お重を全部食べ終わったあとでも\n黒豆を煮れば、まだまだお正月が楽しめそうだな。", "zh": "原来如此。就算吃完了整盒御节料理之后，再煮些黑豆，似乎还能继续享受新年呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "aa602f75ec33a25995cd56e127019624dadaa9a8a4b0aeb5be73af5662b7f4e7", "ja": "{$P$}も、おいしいおせちとお豆を\n一緒に食べて……素敵なお正月を過ごしましょう～！", "zh": "{$P$}也一起吃美味的年节菜和豆子……\n度过一个美好的新年吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0244_1022_p", "source_sha256": "23ce1d5fc80e03dbfce68e7dd622f2a981b3b935956b5de30c017f9643b242b9", "ja": "（やよいは最高の笑顔で撮影に向かってくれそうだ。\n俺も豆、煮てみようかな……今度の休みの日に）", "zh": "（弥生似乎会带着最灿烂的笑容投入拍摄。要不我也试着煮煮豆子吧……等下次休息的时候。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
